Smart Data Engine client libraries
Copyright 2026 Smart Data Engines

This product includes software developed at Smart Data Engines
(https://smartdataengines.com).

The libraries in this repository are the client side of Smart Data Engine: they
declare a data model, cache a placement map, route operations and manage schema.
They connect to database engines directly and they work without an account.

The control plane - the placement planner, the scoring model and the migration
orchestrator - is a separate, private program and is not covered by this notice
or by this licence.
